#basePath	Day2

:: Day2Start
@trigger    Day2Start
@who        Player
@once

$call PlaceAndRotatePlayerAt(WarpDesk, true)
$call SetAllWarpsActive(false)

$call Wait(2)

{@Margo}   Mornin', kiddo!   $[Day2/Tent/Margo_1]
{@Margo}   Jeepers... you look exhausted.   $[Day2/Tent/Margo_2]
{@Player}   Ugh. Is it that obvious?  $[Day2/Tent/Player_1]
{@Player}   I couldn't sleep. I tried counting sheep, counting penguins, stress-eating some Snickers bars . . .   $[Day2/Tent/Player_2]
{@Margo}   Aw, don't worry, kid. The midnight sun takes some gettin' used to.     $[Day2/Tent/Margo_3]
{@Margo}   Just wait til you spend a few days runnin' around after penguins. You'll be so tired you won't know what hit ya.     $[Day2/Tent/Margo_4]

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, true)

:: PickedUpMargo
@trigger    TabletLifted
@who        Player
@interrupt
@once

$call Wait(1)
$set	chapter:hasTalkedToMargo = true

{@Player}    Sounds good to me. Let's get out there!   $[Day2/Tent/Player_3]
{@Margo}   Whoa, slow your roll, kiddo. Last time you almost froze your fingers off, and I've heard those are pretty important for humans.  $[Day2/Tent/Margo_5]
{@Margo}    Got your cold weather gear on?   $[Day2/Tent/Margo_6]
{@Player}    All five layers. Plus some extra hand warmers.    $[Day2/Tent/Player_4]
{@Margo}    Did you make sure to eat a filling breakfast?   $[Day2/Tent/Margo_7]
{@Player}   Margo, I've literally been eating Halloween candy all night.    $[Day2/Tent/Player_5]
{@Margo}    Well, okey dokey, then. Looks like somebody's learnin'.  $[Day2/Tent/Margo_8]
{@Margo}    Whenever you're ready, point me at the door, and we'll head out to the Bluff!     $[Day2/Tent/Margo_9]

$call CreateGoal("Day2_outside", Use Warp to go outside)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, true)

:: WarpedOutsideTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-Bluff"
@once

$call CompleteGoal("Day2_outside")

$call Wait(1)

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluff, false)

{@Player}    Wow, look at them all! $[Day2/Bluff/Player_1]
{@Margo}    Yep, seems we've got some new arrivals. We'll need a new population count. $[Day2/Bluff/Margo_1]
{@Margo}    You’ll also have two tasks down at the Rookery: retrieve your penguins’ GPS trackers, and see if they’ve paired up with a mate. $[Day2/Bluff/Margo_2]
{@Player}   No sweat. I’ve got this. When should we do this? $[Day2/Bluff/Player_2]
{@Margo}   You’re the scientist, kiddo. You tell me. $[Day2/Bluff/Margo_3]
{@Player}   Hmmm, Maybe we should get a head count. $[Day2/Bluff/Player_3]

$call CreateGoal("Day2_count", Use Count to count population)

:: ScannedFromBluff
@trigger	TabletCounted
@who		Player
@interrupt
@once

$call CompleteGoal("Day2_count")

{@Margo}  Great job, kid! We’ve got a new population count.  $[Day2/Bluff/Margo_4]
$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, true)
$call CreateGoal("Day2_rookery", Use Warp to enter rookery)

:: WarpedToRookery
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-Rookery"
@once

$call CompleteGoal("Day2_rookery")

$call Wait(1)

//$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluffBack, true)
$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, true)

$call ClearGoals()

$call CreateGoal("Day2_mates", ID 5 Penguins and their mates)
$call CreateGoal("Day2_trackers", Retrieve 3 trackers from Penguins)

:: WarpedToRookeryMiddle
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-RookeryMiddle"
@once

{@Margo}   Okey dokey. Time to track down the Funtastic Five $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_1]
{@Player}  The Fliptastic Five. $[Day/Rookery/Player_1]
{@Margo}    And get an ID on their mates. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_2]
{@Player}   How can I tell who their mates are? $[Day2/Rookery/Player_2]
{@Margo}    You will need to look for the mating dances.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_3]
{@Player}   Oh. Right. Got it.  $[Day2/Rookery/Player_3]

$call ClearGoals()

$call CreateGoal("id_millie", ID Millie's Mate)
$call CreateGoal("id_alfredo", ID Alfredo's Mate)
$call CreateGoal("id_fuzz", ID Fuzz's Mate)
$call CreateGoal("id_winston", ID Winston's Mate)
$call CreateGoal("id_polo", ID Polo's Mate)

:: OnBillyIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "Billy"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

$call CompleteGoal("id_millie")

{@Player}   Looks like Millie paired up with her same mate from last year!  $[Day2/Rookery/Player_4]
{@Partner}  Millie and . . . Billy? $[Day2/Rookery/Partner_1]
{@Partner}  Hey, you try coming up with names for hundreds of penguins each year. You run out of ideas real quick.  $[Days2/Rookery/Partner_2]

:: OnMeatballIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "Meatball"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

$call CompleteGoal("id_alfredo")

{@Margo}    Hmmm. Alfredo’s mate doesn’t have a tag. Looks like a newbie.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_4]
{@Margo}    Why don’t you go ahead and name him?    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_5]
{@Player}   Oh… me? $[Day2/Rookery/Player_5]
{@Player}   Okay, let’s see. Alfredo and…. um….how about . . . $[Day2/Rookery/Player_6]
{@Player}    . . Meatball?  $[Day2/Rookery/Player_7]
{@Margo}    Ohhhh kaayyy... $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_6]
{@Player}   Now I’m getting hungry. Got any candy bars in that case?    $[Day2/Rookery/Player_8]

:: OnDaisyIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "Daisy"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

$call CompleteGoal("id_fuzz")

{@Margo}    Hmm. Fuzz and Daisy. Interesting.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_7]
{@Player}   What's interesting?  $[Day2/Rookery/Player_9]
{@Margo}    I just hope Fuzz is ready to be a parent. He’s so easily distracted.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_8]
{@Margo}    And it’s the first mating season for both of these penguins.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_9]
{@Player}   I’m sure they’ll be fine. It’s instinct for them, right?    $[Day2/Rookery/Player_10]
{@Margo}    You’d be surprised, kid. Not all penguins make good parents.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_10]
{@Player}   We’ll just have to wait and see.    $[Day2/Rookery/Player_11]

:: OnWendyIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "Wendy"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

$call CompleteGoal("id_winston")

{@Margo}    Aw, Winston and Wendy! I was hopin' they'd find each other again. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_11]
{@Margo}   They've had successful chicks every year. I keep worrying their luck's gonna run out, but so far, so good. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_12]

:: OnBenniIdentified
@function	TabletIdentified
@when		objectId == "Benni"
$set	chapter:identifiedCount + 1

$call CompleteGoal("id_polo")

{@Margo}   Ooh, Benni and Polo! What a good match.  $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_13]
{@Margo}   Polo is such a sweetie. I bet he'll make a great dad.  $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_14]

:: CheckAllMatesIdentified
@trigger    CheckAllMatesIdentified
$if(chapter:identifiedCount >= 5)
    $set	chapter:finishedObservations = true
    $call ClearGoals()
    $if chapter:finishedObservations == true, chapter:finishedTrackers == true
        {@Margo}    Okay, that’s all the data we need!  $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_25]
        {@Margo}    When you're ready we can head back to the research tent and analyze our data.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_26]
        $set chapter:finishedAllObservations = true
        $call CreateGoal("Day2_return", Return to tent)
    $endif
$endif

:: WarpedToRookeryGate
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       targetObject == "WarpTarget-RookeryFar"
@once

{@Margo}    Okay, kid. This is the tricky part. You’ll need to remove each penguin’s GPS tracker. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_15]
{@Margo}    Place one hand on a penguin to hold it still.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_16]
{@Margo}    Then use your other hand to grab the tracker from its leg.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_17]
{@Margo}   And release it near the Pelican Case to drop it inside.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_18]
{@Player}   Got it. No problem. $[Day2/Rookery/Player_4]
{@Margo}    Just watch out for their beaks. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_19]
{@Margo}    These little sweeties might look harmless, but they'll nip ya when they feel threatened.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_20]
{@Margo}    And they've got a mean bite.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_21]
{@Player}   Ha. Very funny. You’re just trying to scare me, right? I mean, they don’t even have teeth!  $[Day2/Rookery/Player_13]
{@Margo}    Oh, you sweet summer child. $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_22]

::OnFuzzTrackerRemoved
@function TrackerRemoved
@when   objectId == "FuzzTracker"
@once

{@Player}   Ouch! Fuzz, just hold still!    $[Day2/Rookery/Player_6]
{@Margo}    Told ya. Those beaks are sharper than they look.    $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_23]

:: OnPenguinLegTrackerSocketed
@function	ObjectSocketed
@when		socketType == "TrackerSocket", objectType == "LegTracker"
@once
$set	chapter:removedCount + 1

$if chapter:removedCount >= 3
	$call TriggerResponse(TrackersCompleted)
$endif

:: TrackersCompleted
@trigger	TrackersCompleted
@who		Player
@once
@interrupt

$set	chapter:finishedTrackers = true
$call ClearGoals()

$call Wait(0.3)
{@Margo}  Nice work, kid! That’s all the GPS trackers.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_24]

$if chapter:finishedObservations == true, chapter:finishedTrackers == true
{@Margo}    Okay, that’s all the data we need!  $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_25]
{@Margo}    When you're ready we can head back to the research tent and analyze our data.   $[Day2/Rookery/Margo_26]
$set chapter:finishedAllObservations = true
$call CreateGoal("Day2_return", Return to tent)
$endif

:: WarpedBackToTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       chapter:finishedAllObservations, targetObject == "WarpTarget-Bluff-Back"
@once

$call Wait(1)

$call SetWarpActive(WarpBluffBack, false)
$call SetWarpGroupActive(Rookery, false)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpDesk, true)

{@Margo} Let's get back in the tent and upload that data!   $[Day2/Bluff/Margo_3]

$call CreateGoal("Day2_upload", Upload Margo's data)

:: WarpedInsideTent
@trigger    AtWarpPoint
@who        Player
@when       chapter:finishedObservations, targetObject == "WarpTarget-Desk"
@interrupt

$call CompleteGoal("Day2_return")
$call Wait(1)
$call SetWarpActive(WarpDesk, true)

{@Margo}    Okay dokey! Just dock me in the port there, and I’ll take a look at our data. $[Day2/Tent/Margo_10]

$while !IsSocketedBy(DeskDock, Margo)
$call Wait(0.5)
$endwhile

$while !ButtonPressed(BigButton)
$call Wait(0.5)
$endwhile

$call CompleteGoal("Day2_upload")

{@Margo}    Looks like the population has increased as more penguins show up for mating season.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_11]
{@Margo}    All five of your penguins have formed breeding pairs!    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_12]
{@Margo}    Most penguin parents lay two eggs each season . . . but not all of them end up hatching.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_13]
{@Margo}    We'll have to wait and see what happens.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_14]
{@Margo}    Nice job, kid. Another excellent day's work.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_15]
{@Margo}    And you've still got plenty of time for trick or treating!  $[Day2/Tent/Margo_16]
{@Margo}    There's a costume parade at McMurdo Station. I'm going as a vintage TV. Penny got me an antenna and everything! $[Day2/Tent/Margo_17]
{@Player}   I think I'll stay here. I checked out a copy of The Thing from the library. $[Day2/Tent/Player_6]
{@Margo}    Yikes. Do you, uh... know what it's about? $[Day2/Tent/Margo_18]
{@Player}   Not really, but I've heard it's pretty spooky.  $[Day2/Tent/Player_7]
{@Margo}    Yeah, ya got that right.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_19]
{@Margo}    You better stock up on more candy... I don't think you'll be gettin' much sleep tonight.    $[Day2/Tent/Margo_20]

$call Wait(2)

$call TriggerResponse(Day3Start)